NativeRoutes_Integration
├── given native routed to WRAP and the wrapped token routed to FORWARD
│   ├── it should preview the native balance as wrapped output
│   ├── it should convert the native balance into wrapped balance on the rails
│   └── it should forward the wrapped balance to the recipient on the next action
├── given native routed to NATIVE_FORWARD
│   ├── when the recipient is an EOA
│   │   └── it should pay the recipient in native
│   ├── when the recipient refuses
│   │   ├── it should report a failed action
│   │   └── it should keep the native on the rails
│   ├── when the recipient burns all gas
│   │   ├── it should report a failed action
│   │   └── it should keep the native on the rails
│   └── when the recipient re-enters executeAction
│       ├── it should block the re-entrant call
│       └── it should complete the first call
├── given the wrapped token routed to UNWRAP and native routed to NATIVE_FORWARD
│   ├── it should turn wrapped balance back into native on the rails
│   ├── it should log the return as a deposit, not a payer receipt
│   └── it should pay the recipient in native on the next action
├── when the native key is configured with an ERC20-only module
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ModuleDoesNotSupportNative
├── when an ERC20 key is routed to a native-only module
│   ├── it should report a failed action
│   ├── it should move no funds
│   └── it should revoke the approval
├── given value arrived without calling receive
│   └── it should be recoverable through a NATIVE_FORWARD route
└── when the owner switches the native route
    └── it should apply only the current route
